      "created": 1792584937598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "bitcask_keydir_entry\n+---------+----------+--------+--------+-----------+--------+------------+\n| file_id | total_sz | offset | epoch  | timestamp | key_sz | key bytes  |\n+---------+----------+--------+--------+-----------+--------+------------+\n| uint32  | uint32   | uint64 | uint64 | uint32    | uint16 | variable   |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "bitcask_keydir_entry\n+---------+----------+--------+--------+-----------+--------+------------+\n| file_id | total_sz | offset | epoch  | timestamp | key_sz | key bytes  |\n+---------+----------+--------+--------+-----------+--------+------------+\n| uint32  | uint32   | uint64 | uint64 | uint32    | uint16 | variable   |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f2mWV7DLBxWAEk1SWcuqQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 197.92895886543624,
      "y": 1732.725987166024,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 446113847,
      "version": 116,
      "versionNonce": 210794873,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792585584979,
      "created": 1792585567355,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                    启动：从磁盘重建内存\n\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    directory files                     |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|  exclude active write/merge and pending-delete files   |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|           sort by file_id: oldest -> newest            |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|                   scan key metadata                    |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n  +--------------------+---------------------------------+\n  | metadata           | KeyDir action                   |\n  +--------------------+---------------------------------+\n  | regular record     | put current entry               |\n  | tombstone          | remove entry                    |\n  +--------------------+---------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|          rebuild fstats and mark KeyDir ready          |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                    启动：从磁盘重建内存\n\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|                    directory files                     |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|  exclude active write/merge and pending-delete files   |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|           sort by file_id: oldest -> newest            |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|                   scan key metadata                    |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n  +--------------------+---------------------------------+\n  | metadata           | KeyDir action                   |\n  +--------------------+---------------------------------+\n  | regular record     | put current entry               |\n  | tombstone          | remove entry                    |\n  +--------------------+---------------------------------+\n                             |\n                             v\n+--------------------------------------------------------+\n|          rebuild fstats and mark KeyDir ready          |\n+--------------------------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xFkuMwskDUPYwXP3hxZSu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1191.6617143574204,
      "y": 1751.1895733599374,
      "width": 671,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1292941367,
      "version": 105,
      "versionNonce": 915089847,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792587989505,
      "created": 1792587971162,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "               KeyDir 决定一条记录是否仍然存活\n\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n|           selected data files, sorted by file_id          |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n                              |\n                              v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n|                     scan every record                     |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n                              |\n                              v\n+---------------------------------+-------------------------+\n| condition                       | action                  |\n+---------------------------------+-------------------------+\n| expired                         | drop                    |\n| newer timestamp in KeyDir       | drop                    |\n| same ts; newer file_id/offset   | drop                    |\n| record is still current         | append to merge output  |\n+---------------------------------+-------------------------+\n                              |\n                              v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n|              append new data and hint records             |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "               KeyDir 决定一条记录是否仍然存活\n\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n|           selected data files, sorted by file_id          |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n                              |\n                              v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n|                     scan every record                     |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n                              |\n                              v\n+---------------------------------+-------------------------+\n| condition                       | action                  |\n+---------------------------------+-------------------------+\n| expired                         | drop                    |\n| newer timestamp in KeyDir       | drop                    |\n| same ts; newer file_id/offset   | drop                    |\n| record is still current         | append to merge output  |\n+---------------------------------+-------------------------+\n                              |\n                              v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n|              append new data and hint records             |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    }
  ],
